10. **Locale for qualitative AI evaluation** — not just pen pictures.
11. **No forced strengths/development areas** — empty arrays legitimate.
12. **Observability assigned to exact phases** — Phase 0 + Phase 10.
13. **DOCUMENT_REFERENCE security** — no SSRF, URI validation only.
14. **Explicit source-data correction mechanism** — superseding records + input snapshot pinning.

